 "heading": "GPOM · the bridge: Maddie at the door (draft 1G)",
 "intro": "The bridge between the kill bots standing down and the humans following Maddie out. Draft 1G, voiced; the five new clips plus stand-ins from the old door scene. Play it, click any beat, clip, line or sound and leave a note in its yellow slip. Tell Claude when you are done.",
